<title>CHINA: Heilongjiang dividend plan approved.</title>
<headline>Heilongjiang dividend plan approved.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Heilongjiang Electric Power Co Ltd have given approval for a cash dividend of 0.231 yuan per A share and 0.17325 yuan per B share, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The B share dividend will be calculated in U.S. dollars at an exchange rate of 8.2951 yuan, the statement said. The dividend for B share holders is less than that for A shares because the B shares were only issued in April 1996, it said.</p>
<p>Ex-dividend day for both A and B shares is April 25, the statement said.</p>
<p>Trading of the firm's A and B shares was suspended on Tuesday morning and will resume in the afternoon, it said.</p>
</text>
